## Phase 1: Architecture + Database Foundation

### Objective
Establish the v2.0 database schema, migration scripts, storage buckets, and core infrastructure needed by all subsequent features.

### Deliverables

| # | Deliverable | Type | File |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1.1 | v2.0 database migration script | SQL | `005_v2_schema.sql` |
| 1.2 | v2.0 RLS policies | SQL | `006_v2_security.sql` |
| 1.3 | v2.0 SQL functions | SQL | `007_v2_functions.sql` |
| 1.4 | v1.0 → v2.0 data migration | SQL | `008_v2_migration.sql` |
| 1.5 | Test seed data | SQL | `009_v2_seed.sql` |
| 1.6 | Supabase Storage buckets | SQL | `010_v2_storage.sql` |
| 1.7 | Updated Swift models | Swift | `Models/*.swift` |
| 1.8 | User model and auth extension | Swift | `User.swift`, `AuthService.swift` |

### Dependencies
- Supabase project access
- v1.0 database backup

### KPIs
- KPI-2-042 (RLS on all tables)
- KPI-2-054 (Data consistency)
- KPI-2-056 (Migration integrity)

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] All new tables created with correct constraints
- [ ] RLS enabled on all tables
- [ ] v1.0 data migrated without loss
- [ ] SQL functions return correct results
- [ ] Storage buckets configured
- [ ] Swift models compile and decode test data

### Estimated Effort: 2-3 days

