## Implementation Timeline Summary

| Phase | Duration | Cumulative | Features |
|---|---|---|---|
| Phase 1 | 2-3 days | Week 1 | Database + Architecture |
| Phase 2 | 4-5 days | Week 1-2 | Campaign Creation + Verification |
| Phase 3 | 4-5 days | Week 2-3 | Marketplace + Discovery |
| Phase 4 | 5-6 days | Week 3-4 | Payments + Receipts + Subscriptions |
| Phase 5 | 3-4 days | Week 4-5 | AI Reports + Dashboard |
| Phase 6 | 3-4 days | Week 5-6 | Testing + Polish + Release |
| **Total** | **21-27 days** | **~6 weeks** | **All v2.0 features** |

---

## Risk Mitigation During Implementation

| Risk | Phase | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Migration data loss | Phase 1 | Backup before migration; rollback script |
| Razorpay Subscriptions complexity | Phase 4 | Feature flag; start early research |
| AI report quality | Phase 5 | Human review; quality threshold |
| Performance regression | Phase 6 | Profile early; lazy loading |
| Security gap | Phase 6 | Security audit before release |
